// Centre-Left gov/pres gives better minimum wage, lowers costs of public utility, but higher taxes
// Left gov is centre-left but both positive and negative effects are doubled
// Centre-Right gives lower taxes and lower commodity costs, but lower minimum wage, higher costs of public utility, and less tax returns
